WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:25.591
Bobby waved good-bye to his mom and walked inside the school.

2
00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:29.513
It felt a little weird to be there.

3
00:00:29.514 --> 00:00:35.415
He wasn't going to class.

4
00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:38.310
And he wasn't going to Kids Central.

5
00:00:38.311 --> 00:00:43.133
He was going to Kids Central summer camp!

6
00:00:43.134 --> 00:00:49.614
In the gym Bobby saw a bucket of water balloons.

7
00:00:49.615 --> 00:00:55.283
A tall man was wearing a T-shirt that said: "Kids Central Summer Camp."

8
00:00:55.284 --> 00:00:58.109
He also had on a baseball cap.

9
00:00:58.110 --> 00:01:01.586
"Welcome, camper," the man said.

10
00:01:01.587 --> 00:01:05.968
"Let me guess. Bobby?"

11
00:01:05.969 --> 00:01:10.303
"That's me," Bobby said.

12
00:01:10.304 --> 00:01:12.647
"Are you Mr. Dunn?"

13
00:01:12.648 --> 00:01:16.861
His mom had told him Miss Shelly wouldn't be teaching this summer.

14
00:01:16.862 --> 00:01:21.052
Mr. Dunn smiled. "That's me.

15
00:01:21.053 --> 00:01:24.982
My friend Miss Shelly told me all about you.

16
00:01:24.983 --> 00:01:29.691
I hear you're on your way to becoming a basketball star."

17
00:01:29.692 --> 00:01:32.164
Bobby tried not to grin.

18
00:01:32.165 --> 00:01:35.812
"Nah," he said.

19
00:01:35.813 --> 00:01:41.010
Suddenly the gym door burst open and two girls rushed in.

20
00:01:41.011 --> 00:01:47.174
"Nina! Izzie! You guys are here for the summer too?" Bobby said.

21
00:01:47.175 --> 00:01:50.510
"The whole summer," Izzie said.

22
00:01:50.511 --> 00:01:53.691
"I can't wait," said Nina.

23
00:01:53.692 --> 00:01:56.128
"Even though I'm here already."

24
00:01:56.129 --> 00:01:58.532
The two girls giggled.

25
00:01:58.533 --> 00:02:01.274
Then they looked up at their new teacher.

26
00:02:01.275 --> 00:02:04.226
"Hi, Mr. Dunn," they said.

27
00:02:04.227 --> 00:02:07.579
"Nice to meet you," Mr. Dunn said.

28
00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:09.299
"We're just waiting for—"

29
00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:13.761
"Jason and Ethan!" Izzie squealed.

30
00:02:13.762 --> 00:02:17.747
"That's right." Mr. Dunn looked surprised.

31
00:02:17.748 --> 00:02:22.121
"No. I mean Jason and Ethan are here!"

32
00:02:22.122 --> 00:02:26.705
Izzie pointed as Jason and Ethan walked over to them.

33
00:02:26.706 --> 00:02:31.667
"Great. Jason, Ethan, I'm Mr. Dunn.

34
00:02:31.668 --> 00:02:35.013
Everybody, follow me outside."

35
00:02:35.014 --> 00:02:38.297
Mr. Dunn led them to the blacktop.

36
00:02:38.298 --> 00:02:42.679
"We're going to have a get-to-know-you water balloon toss.

37
00:02:42.680 --> 00:02:44.973
Please get into pairs."

38
00:02:44.974 --> 00:02:48.122
Izzie and Nina paired up first.

39
00:02:48.123 --> 00:02:52.607
Then Jason and Ethan paired up.

40
00:02:52.608 --> 00:02:56.865
"Bobby, will you be my partner?" Mr. Dunn asked.

41
00:02:56.866 --> 00:03:01.017
Bobby's face brightened. "Sure!"

42
00:03:01.018 --> 00:03:09.075
"We'll start facing each other," Mr. Dunn explained.

43
00:03:09.076 --> 00:03:11.774
"One person holds the balloon.

44
00:03:11.775 --> 00:03:16.986
When you toss the balloon, say something you know about your partner.

45
00:03:16.987 --> 00:03:22.695
For example." Mr. Dunn looked at Bobby.

46
00:03:22.696 --> 00:03:24.954
"Bobby likes basketball!"

47
00:03:24.955 --> 00:03:28.050
he said as he tossed Bobby the water balloon.

48
00:03:28.051 --> 00:03:30.676
Bobby caught it easily.

49
00:03:30.677 --> 00:03:35.041
"When you catch the balloon, take one step back.

50
00:03:35.042 --> 00:03:39.749
Then toss it to your partner and say something about him or her.

51
00:03:39.750 --> 00:03:41.372
Get it?"

52
00:03:41.373 --> 00:03:43.924
Mr. Dunn looked at everyone.

53
00:03:43.925 --> 00:03:50.081
"Got it!" Izzie held a balloon over her head.

54
00:03:50.082 --> 00:03:53.408
"Be careful, Izzie," Nina said.

55
00:03:53.409 --> 00:03:57.580
"If you burst that balloon, we're out of the game."

56
00:03:57.581 --> 00:04:01.171
"Nina's right," said Mr. Dunn.

57
00:04:01.172 --> 00:04:06.563
"The last pair with a water balloon is the winner."

58
00:04:06.564 --> 00:04:10.137
The partners lined up facing each other.

59
00:04:10.138 --> 00:04:16.910
"Jason likes to cook!" Ethan called, tossing the balloon.

60
00:04:16.911 --> 00:04:22.228
"Ethan likes the ocean!" Jason threw it back to his partner.

61
00:04:22.229 --> 00:04:29.290
"Nina's good at jumping rope," Izzie said.

62
00:04:29.291 --> 00:04:33.474
"Izzie's good at making people laugh," Nina said.

63
00:04:33.475 --> 00:04:37.298
Bobby still hadn't thrown his balloon.

64
00:04:37.299 --> 00:04:40.226
"Uh-oh, Mr. Dunn.

65
00:04:40.227 --> 00:04:44.000
I don't know anything about you," he said.

66
00:04:44.001 --> 00:04:50.478
"Sure, you do," Mr. Dunn said. "Think."

67
00:04:50.479 --> 00:04:54.266
"You ride your bike to camp!" Izzie said.

68
00:04:54.267 --> 00:04:57.662
"You like to garden!" Ethan said.

69
00:04:57.663 --> 00:05:03.136
Bobby smiled. "You're friends with Miss Shelly!"

70
00:05:03.137 --> 00:05:06.706
The kids cheered.

71
00:05:06.707 --> 00:05:14.200
"This summer is going to be fun!" Bobby thought.
